Tool input schema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "username": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Username for the account"
    },
    "email": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "email",
      "description": "User's email address"
    },
    "age": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 18,
      "description": "User's age (must be 18 or older)"
    }
  },
  "required": ["username", "age"]
}

The agent will try to create a user with uppercase letters in the username.

